# The Companion's task panel shows who and what a task is connected to (Knots
# kt-pv24, the web's 9/21 task panel): owner and creator as name and handle,
# tags, subscribers with the count (employees named, a group counted), and a
# Related page -- linked diffs with their status, the tasks it depends on,
# subtasks -- in its own read. A row opens that task right here.
#
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":760,"open_tabs":["t2"],"active_tab":"t2","theme":"dark"}

require_thread t2
open_companion T555
wait_frames 20
expect_text "owner Pat Owner (pat)"
expect_text "filed by Sam Filer (sam)"
expect_text "Subscribers (3): Pat Owner (pat), Rae Reviewer (rae) and 1 more"
click_ui companion_page_related
wait_frames 20
expect_text "Diffs (1)"
expect_text "D117423523  Retry the reconcile once  ·  Needs Review"
expect_text "Depends on (1)"
expect_text "Subtasks (2)"
expect_text "T557  Log the delta  ·  Closed"
expect_no_text "Blocks ("
click_ui companion_related_T556
wait_frames 20
expect_text "T556"
expect_text "Reconcile batch should retry once"
